You're building a book lending system for a public library. Library members need to borrow books, return them, and the library needs to track which books are available.

User Story: As a library member, I want to borrow books from the library and return them when I'm done, so that I can read books without purchasing them.

Requirements:

The library has a catalog of books, each with an ISBN

The library may have multiple copies of the same book

A member can borrow an available copy of a book

A member is identified by a member ID

Track which member has borrowed which book

A book can only be borrowed if a copy is available

When a member returns a book, it becomes available again